    hosted sandbox execution, hosted schedules, shared memory, and usage
    reporting;
  * removal of outbound telemetry and third-party error/feedback reporting;
    such diagnostics are written to local log files instead;
  * renaming of the package, the executable, the environment-variable prefix,
    and the configuration directory;
  * replacement of product branding, the colour palette, the bundled default
    image asset, and the ASCII-art logo served by the OAuth callback page;
  * removal of the bundled skills and assets that existed only to drive the
    removed cloud features;
  * additions and changes to memory, context management, prefix freezing,
    topic-based trimming, scheduling, and the local backend.

